    { "q": "What makes your designs different?", "a": "We design the water treatment first and choose the equipment second, which is the opposite of fitting a standard package and hoping it suits the site. Every design starts from the specific problem in front of us, drawing on more than twenty years of experience across a wide range of supplies and buildings. The result is a system built around your water and your demand, rather than around a supplier's catalogue." },
    { "q": "Why design the treatment before choosing the equipment?", "a": "Because the equipment is only as good as the thinking behind it. If you select hardware before you understand the water, you tend to end up correcting the wrong things, or over-treating in some areas and under-treating in others. By fixing the treatment strategy first, we make sure each piece of equipment earns its place and works as part of a considered whole." },
